title Record One Qualified Skill Use - Pending implementation
participant "Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Root usage tracker" as Tracker
participant "Statistics service" as Service
database GaussDB as DB
Runtime -> Tracker : Qualified Skill signal for the real root
Tracker -> Tracker : Deduplicate attempted Skill; release memory lock
Tracker -> Service : Record first qualified candidate
Service -> DB : Independent transaction; lock and recheck admission
alt New admissible usage fact
  Service -> DB : Insert fact; increment total and daily count
  DB --> Service : Commit all three tables or raise failure
else Closed admission or existing fact
  DB --> Service : No increments
end
Service --> Tracker : Recorded, skipped or failed
Tracker --> Runtime : Unchanged main result; no automatic retry
note over Tracker,DB
  Statistics failure never replays a tool.
  Persistent uniqueness prevents double counting after restore.
end note
@enduml
